    {
      "source": "Find the Docker Compose file by searching in the given working directory. Files are\nconsidered in the same order that <code>docker compose</code> uses, namely:\n<ul>\n<li><code>compose.yaml</code></li>\n<li><code>compose.yml</code></li>\n<li><code>docker-compose.yaml</code></li>\n<li><code>docker-compose.yml</code></li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "在给定工作目录中搜索 Docker Compose 文件。文件的考虑顺序与 `<code>docker compose</code>` 使用的顺序一致，即：\n<ul>\n<li><code>compose.yaml</code></li>\n<li><code>compose.yml</code></li>\n<li><code>docker-compose.yaml</code></li>\n<li><code>docker-compose.yml</code></li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>workingDirectory</code> - the working directory to search or <code>null</code> to use the\ncurrent directory",
      "translation": "<code>workingDirectory</code> - 要搜索的工作目录，或为 <code>null</code> 以使用当前目录",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the located file or <code>null</code> if no Docker Compose file can be found",
      "translation": "找到的文件或如果找不到 Docker Compose 文件则为<code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>files</code> - the source files",
      "translation": "<code>files</code> - 源文件",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the source Docker Compose files",
      "translation": "源 Docker Compose 文件",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A reference to a Docker Compose file (usually named <code>compose.yaml</code>).",
      "translation": "对 Docker Compose 文件的引用（通常命名为<code>compose.yaml</code>）。",
      "count": 2
